{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BKj8zkrPYfFLEjPxXdVwDd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All work is complete. Here's a summary:\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. **Created `pkg/format/table.go`** — Column alignment functions (`Columns`, `PadRight`, `PadLeft`, `displayWidth`) implementing prd003-format R1.1-R1.4. Uses row-major order matching `gls --format=across`, per-column width computation, and rune-based display width.\n\n2. **`pkg/format/color.go`** — No changes needed. Existing implementation already satisfies prd003-format R2.1-R2.7: `FileTypeColor`, `Reset`, `ColorEnabled`, `SetColorEnabled`, `ResetColorEnabled` with GNU ls LS_COLORS defaults and TTY auto-detection.\n\n3. **`pkg/format/size.go`** — No changes needed. Existing implementation already satisfies prd003-format R3.1-R3.6: `HumanSize` with `HumanSizeOpts` supporting both binary (1024) and SI (1000) modes.\n\n4. **Removed `pkg/format/column.go`** — Content moved to `table.go` per design decision D1.\n\n**Acceptance criteria verified:**\n- **AC1**: `go build ./pkg/format/...` compiles with no errors\n- **AC2**: `go vet ./pkg/format/...` passes with no warnings\n- **AC3**: Exported APIs match the PRD — `Columns`, `PadRight`, `PadLeft`, `FileTypeColor`, `Reset`, `ColorEnabled`, `SetColorEnabled`, `ResetColorEnabled`, `HumanSize`, `HumanSizeOpts`\n- **AC4**: No imports from `pkg/sys`, `pkg/testutils`, or any external module"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":343,"cache_read_input_tokens":61022,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":343,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"42bb9627-c016-4ec5-b3b3-3f0638943305","uuid":"da313e83-cccd-4434-8e3b-aa58f5b2ca94"}
